# Non-secret config (COMMITTED). Runtime `.env` = this + vault secrets via
#   wf secret sync-env --for ci-runner --base .env.defaults --out .env
# Secrets (from the vault, NEVER here): TS_VM_AUTH_KEY (joins the ci-runner-<host> tailnet node). The runner's environment holds no vm-ops-api or gateway seed.
# RUNNER_TOKEN (a one-hour registration token) is minted by `wf ship ci-runner` and appended after this file is synced; the
#   VM_PROVISION_GITHUB_TOKEN PAT that mints it stays in agent-shell and is not part of this group.
# BWS_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN and BWS_SERVER_URL come from .env.local on the host, as for every other app.
